msgstr "&kmyapplication; Priručnik"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It manages speaker data (users, institutions) as well as sample meta data "
"using a database and stores the samples."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It receives input from the SSC client(s) which connect to the server using "
"TCP/IP."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information on the general architecture of the Simon suite please "
"see the <ulink url=\"help:/simon/overview.html#architecture\">Simon manual</"
"ulink>. For information about the SSC client, please refer to the <ulink url="
"\"help:/ssc\">SSC manual</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kmyapplication;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kmyapplication;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmyapplication; is a command line application which does not have any user "
"interface. There are no special launch parameters."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Base folder"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The base folder of &kmyapplication; contains the configuration file "
"<filename>sscd.conf</filename> and an error log in case something goes "
"wrong. This folder also contains the <filename>samples</filename> subfolder "
"where all the samples are stored."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "The location of the SSCd folder depends on your operating system:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "SSC base folder"
msgstr ""

